{'symbol': 'HUM', 'date': '2022-11-22 16:15:00', 'title': 'HUMANA COMPLETES AGGREGATE $1.25 BILLION DEBT OFFERING', 'text': "LOUISVILLE, KY.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--HUMANA INC. (THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: HUM) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE COMPLETION OF ITS PUBLIC OFFERING OF $1.25 BILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF SENIOR NOTES. THESE SENIOR NOTES ARE COMPRISED OF $500 MILLION OF THE COMPANY'S 5.750 PERCENT SENIOR NOTES, DUE 2028 (THE “2028 NOTES”), AT 99.705 PERCENT OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT AND $750 MILLION OF THE COMPANY'S 5.875 PERCENT SENIOR NOTES, DUE 2033 (THE “2033 NOTES”), AT 99.508 PERCENT OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT (COLLECTIVELY, THE “SENIOR NOTES OFFERINGS”)."}